Package: uniwill-laptop-dkms
Version: @PACKAGE_VERSION@
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: uniwill-laptop contributors
Depends: dkms, btrfs-progs, dosfstools, kmod, libblockdev3, libblockdev-fs3, libblockdev-nvme3, libblockdev-smart3, libglib2.0-0t64 | libglib2.0-0, libsystemd0, ntfs-3g, systemd, udev, xfsprogs
Provides: uniwill-laptop, uniwilld
Conflicts: uniwill-laptop, uniwilld
Description: Uniwill laptop DKMS driver and hardware control service
 Installs the out-of-tree Uniwill laptop kernel driver through DKMS together
 with the uniwilld hardware-control service, systemd integration, udev rules,
 and the desktop-session touchpad synchronization helper.
